Meeting summary for 29 April 2026:

  * *Updated: OpenVPN 2.7.x releases*
    2.7.2 and 2.6.20 were released last week. They address CVE issues
    (see details onhttps://community.openvpn.net/Downloads).
    Unfortunately an issue slipped through in regards to handling
    credentials stored inline in config files. So a 2.7.3 was released
    on Monday 27 april to address that particular issue.
    There is now an investigation ongoing with a small issue with DNS
    implementation on 2.7.2 and 2.7.3.
    A small 2.7.4 release will follow soon to solve that particular
    issue too.

As always you're welcome to join at #openvpn-meeting on Libera IRC 
network every Wednesday at 14:00 Central European Time.

Kind regards,
Johan Draaisma

